# "Destroy target creature or planeswalker with mana value 3 or less." Bot2 has Brazen Borrower (creature, mana value 3), Displacer Kitten (creature,
# mana value 4), a Mox Sapphire (a noncreature permanent) and an Island. Long Goodbye cannot target the Kitten (too expensive), the Island or the
# Mox (neither a creature nor a planeswalker) - the refusals - and destroys the Borrower (the positive control: the same action at mana value 3).

